        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you..\r\n\r\n1 Bedroom 1 Bathroom, Parking Ground Floor Apartment \r\nPerfect for those looking to downscale \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and LWK are delighted to prescent No 2 Ferndale to the Rathmichael property market.\r\nNo. 2 Ferndale Court is a beautifully presented one-bedroom ground-floor apartment, recently renovated and lovingly maintained, set in a tranquil and mature woodland environment in the highly sought-after Rathmichael area. Discreetly located on Allies River Road, just off Ferndale Road, Ferndale Court is a secure gated development built in 2002 and comprising approximately fifty properties arranged around a charming courtyard setting. The development enjoys generous off-street parking, mature communal gardens and a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquillity, while remaining conveniently located for the many amenities of Rathmichael, Shankill and Bray.\r\n\r\nOn arrival at Ferndale Court, residents and visitors enter through secure electronic gates, creating a private and welcoming approach to the development. No. 2 is positioned on the ground floor and enjoys a particularly peaceful setting within the development.\r\n\r\nThe property itself is immediately impressive, with a bright and welcoming interior that combines generous proportions with a contemporary feel. Upon entering through the double French doors, you are greeted by a large and inviting dining and living room. This spacious room features attractive wood flooring, high ceilings and a beautiful feature fireplace, creating a warm and comfortable space that is equally suited to relaxing at home or entertaining guests. The excellent ceiling height and natural light give the room a wonderful sense of space.\r\n\r\nThe dining area leads seamlessly towards the kitchen, with large double doors incorporating glazed panels providing the option of either opening the space up or closing it off when preferred. The contemporary kitchen is both stylish and practical, offering an excellent range of base and eye-level units together with generous storage and modern appliances. Positioned towards the front of the property, the kitchen enjoys a pleasant outlook and connects beautifully with the dining area.\r\n\r\nMoving through the property, the hallway leads to the remaining accommodation. To the right is a very useful walk-in wardrobe with fitted storage, providing excellent additional space for clothes and general household storage. To the left is the generous family bathroom, which is finished with quality sanitary ware and presented in excellent condition.\r\n\r\nThe main bedroom is a bright and peaceful room with excellent natural light and a lovely sense of privacy. A glazed door provides direct access from the bedroom onto the patio, creating a wonderful additional space to enjoy during the warmer months. The patio is an ideal spot for relaxing with a morning coffee, reading a book or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings of Ferndale Court.\r\n\r\nThe location is one of the property's particular attractions. Rathmichael is renowned for its leafy surroundings and its proximity to both Dublin and Wicklow, offering residents the best of both worlds. Shankill village is close by and provides a good range of local shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities, while Bray is just a short distance away and offers an extensive selection of shopping, restaurants, leisure facilities and coastal amenities. The surrounding area is also well served by recreational facilities, with a number of golf clubs, walking routes and coastal destinations within easy reach.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the property benefits from convenient access to the N11 and M50, providing routes into Dublin city and throughout the wider Dublin and Wicklow areas. Shankill DART station provides rail connections towards Dublin city and the south Dublin suburbs, while the LUAS Green Line at Brides Glen is also accessible from the area. Cherrywood Business Campus and the surrounding commercial districts are within easy reach, further enhancing the property's appeal.\r\n\r\nThe area is also well served by a selection of primary and secondary schools. John Scottus School is located on Ferndale Road at Old Conna, while Rathmichael Parish National School and St Anne's National School are located nearby in Shankill. Bray and the surrounding area offer a further choice of schools and educational facilities.\r\n\r\nNo. 2 Ferndale Court offers a rare combination of a peaceful woodland setting, secure gated surroundings, generous accommodation and modern interiors, together with excellent transport links and easy access to the amenities of Rathmichael, Shankill and Bray. Recently renovated and presented in excellent condition throughout, this lovely ground-floor apartment would make an ideal home for a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor seeking a well-located property in a mature and established development.\r\n\r\nWe are a proud affiliate of Keller Williams, the worlds largest property brand with excess of 180,000 agents worldwide working together to source a buyer for your property\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
